rticipate in the 4,000 miles of grueling adventure.\n\n\n\n(Source: STEEL BALL RUN: JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken Site)"],"ja":["ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 スティール・ボール・ラン 1st STAGE",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-78368":"2026-10-23T20:51:16Z","serial-73718":"2026-10-23T09:17:40Z","serial-78337":"2026-10-23T14:15:00Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-78368","serial-73718","serial-78337"],"relatedMalIds":[51367,61469],"availableEpisodeCount":6,"rating":9.04,"relations":[{"id":51367,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":61469,"relation":"sequel"}]}]}